      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Rebellion is using this building for the moment.",
      "translation" : "反叛军暂时使用这栋建筑。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Along with a few others around it.",
      "translation" : "附近还有几栋建筑也由我们使用。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We haven't been this busy for a long time.",
      "translation" : "我们已经很久没有这么忙过了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't like that we're working with the President and the company, but it still feels good to be busy with something.",
      "translation" : "我不喜欢和总统以及公司合作，不过能忙起来感觉还不错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So, you received the message. The Captains are having a meeting on the inside. Captain Elena Volkova must have called you.",
      "translation" : "你收到消息了。队长们正在里面开会。一定是埃琳娜·沃尔科娃队长叫你来的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "... I was going to call her, but she's already here.",
      "translation" : "...我正准备联系她，没想到她已经到了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Rebellion]",
      "translation" : "[反叛军]"
