      "npc" : "Rebellion",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Each Module requires 30 Mysterious Components and 5 Cor Cores. You don't have them all. Please check.",
      "translation" : "每个模块需要30个神秘零件和5个科尔核心。你没有带齐，请检查一下。"
